#. y4:msg_phrase=1
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P1
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "68_Kiryu"
msgid "It's been a while, Kazuki."
msgstr "Ha pasado su tiempo, Kazuki."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=3
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P3
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kazuki
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "92_Kazuki"
msgid "Oh, Kiryu-san! It sure has!"
msgstr "¡Oh, Kiryu-san! ¡Seguro que sí!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=4
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P4
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "104_Kiryu"
msgid "How are things going?"
msgstr "¿Cómo van las cosas?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=5
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P5
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kazuki
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "116_Kazuki"
msgid "Well enough... I guess."
msgstr "Bastante bien... creo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=6
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P6
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "128_Kiryu"
msgid "You guess?"
msgstr "¿Tú crees?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=7
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P7
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "140_Kiryu"
msgid "Are you worried about what's going on with Yuya and Shinya?"
msgstr "¿Estás preocupado por lo que está pasando con Yuya y Shinya?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=8
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P8
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kazuki
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "152_Kazuki"
msgid "Huh? You heard about that!?"
msgstr "¿Eh? ¡¿Has oído hablar de eso?!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=9
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P9
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "164_Kiryu"
msgid "Yeah. I saw them going at it outside of the club earlier."
msgstr "Sí. Los vi discutiendo afuera del club hace un rato."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176_Kazuki"
msgid "Sorry you had to see that. Not exactly the image we want\\r\nto project to the world."
msgstr "Lamento que tuvieras que ver eso. No es exactamente la imagen que queremos\\r\nproyectar al mundo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "188_Kazuki"
msgid "Even though he's the manager now, Yuya can still get a bit\\r\nhot under the collar at times."
msgstr "Incluso de que ahora es el gerente, Yuya todavía puede tener los papeles\\r\ndesacomodados delante de su cara."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "200_Kiryu"
msgid "I wouldn't worry about it. It's nice to see a man have\\r\npassion for his work, and it seems to me he has it in\\r\nspades."
msgstr "No me preocuparía por ello. Es agradable ver a un hombre tener\\r\npasión por su trabajo, y me parece que la posee en\\r\nabundancia."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "212_Kazuki"
msgid "Agreed. That's why I chose to let him take over as manager.\\r\nI knew I could count on him when things went south."
msgstr "Estoy de acuerdo. Por eso elegí dejar que se haga cargo del puesto.\\r\nSabía que podía contar con él cuando las cosas vayan en picada."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=14
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P14
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "224_Kiryu"
msgid "Speaking of which, what do you think he should do about the whole tab situation?"
msgstr "Hablando de eso, ¿qué crees que debería hacer con esta situación de la cuenta?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "236_Kazuki"
msgid "Like I said, Yuya's the manager now. So I fully stand behind\\r\nwhatever decision he makes, of course, but..."
msgstr "Como dije, Yuya es el gerente ahora. Así que apoyo por completo sea cual sea\\r\nla decisión que tome, por supuesto, pero..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=16
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P16
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "248_Kiryu"
msgid "But what?"
msgstr "¿Qué?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "260_Kazuki"
msgid "Well, a lot of times when a host lets a customer run up a\\r\nbig tab like that, he has some kind of ulterior motive."
msgstr "Bueno, muchas veces cuando un host permite que un cliente se vaya con una cuenta\\r\na pagar tan grande como esa, tiene algún tipo de motivo oculto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=18
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P18
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "272_Kiryu"
msgid "Oh?"
msgstr "Oh..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "284_Kazuki"
msgid "That's my opinion, at least. No matter how young, green, or\\r\neasy to manipulate a customer may be..."
msgstr "Esa es mi opinión, al menos. No importa cuán joven, verde o\\r\nfácil de manipular el cliente pueda ser..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "296_Kazuki"
msgid "It doesn't make sense to advance someone that kind of\\r\ncredit. 5 million yen is no small amount."
msgstr "No tiene sentido apurar a alguien de esa manera por ese tipo de\\r\ncrédito. 5 millones de yenes no es poca cantidad."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=21
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P21
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "308_Kiryu"
msgid "Still, it's not unheard of."
msgstr "Aun así, no es algo de lo que no haya oído ya."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=22
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P22
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kazuki
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "320_Kazuki"
msgid "True enough."
msgstr "Es verdad."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "332_Kazuki"
msgid "Usually, though, it's a case of the host needing to boost\\r\nhis sales figures. The easiest way to accomplish this is to\\r\npressure a customer into ordering pricey drinks."
msgstr "Por lo general, se trata de un caso en el que el host necesita impulsar\\r\nsus cifras de ventas. La forma más fácil de lograr esto es\\r\npresionar a un cliente para que pida bebidas caras."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "344_Kazuki"
msgid "But for some reason, I don't believe that was the case this\\r\ntime. Honestly, I have the feeling Mitsuru was set up."
msgstr "Pero por alguna razón, no creo que ese fuera el caso esta\\r\nvez. Honestamente, tengo la sensación de que a Mitsuru le tendieron una trampa."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=25
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P25
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "356_Kiryu"
msgid "Set up? Who would do something like that?"
msgstr "¿Una trampa? ¿Quién haría algo así?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "368_Kazuki"
msgid "Good question. Even if that were the case, though... I can't\\r\nsimply take matters into my own hands."
msgstr "Buena pregunta. Incluso si ese fuera el caso... No puedo\\r\nsimplemente encargarme del asunto yo mismo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "380_Kazuki"
msgid "Yuya is the manager, which means he's the one who needs to\\r\nhandle these kinds of problems."
msgstr "Yuya es el gerente, lo que significa que él es el que tiene que hacerlo\\r\ny manejar este tipo de problemas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "392_Kiryu"
msgid "I guess what happens to Mitsuru all depends on Yuya's skill\\r\nas a manager, then."
msgstr "Supongo que lo que le pase a Mitsuru depende de la habilidad de Yuya\\r\ncomo gerente, entonces."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=30
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P30
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kazuki
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "416_Kazuki"
msgid "You know, at times I think Yuya is too kind for this job..."
msgstr "Sabes, a veces pienso que Yuya es demasiado amable para este trabajo..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=31
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P31
#. y4:msg_speaker=Kiryu
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "428_Kiryu"
msgid "Hm..."
msgstr "Mm..."
